---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Preise & Kosten | SEO, SEA, Webentwicklung & Tracking | Valorferrum"
  description="Transparente Preise für SEO, SEA, Webentwicklung und Tracking. 110 €/h oder Festpreispakete. Keine versteckten Kosten. Fair kalkuliert."
  lang="de"
>
  <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/8 rounded-full blur-[120px] pulse-anim"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <h1 class="reveal font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">
        Transparente Preise
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        Festpreis oder Stundensatz. Keine Pakete mit Ballast, keine versteckten Kosten.
        Fair kalkuliert – basierend auf realer Kostendeckung und nachvollziehbaren Puffern.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== STUNDENSATZ ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6" aria-labelledby="stundensatz-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="reveal p-10 md:p-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-spectrum-pink/5 to-spectrum-blue/10 border border-primary/20 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <h2 id="stundensatz-heading" class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
            Stundensatz
          </h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Für laufende Betreuung, Workshops, Ad-hoc-Anfragen oder Projekte,
            deren Umfang noch nicht klar definiert ist.
          </p>
          <div class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-primary font-display mb-3">110 €<span class="text-2xl text-text-secondary font-normal">/h</span></div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">
            Abgerechnet in 15-Minuten-Schritten. Keine Mindestlaufzeit, keine versteckten Aufschläge.
            Bei unsicheren Projekten: +10 % Risikoaufschlag. Daueraufträge ab 3 Monaten ohne Aufschlag.
          </p>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="inline-flex px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 hover:shadow-primary/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
            Projekt anfragen
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== STUNDENSATZ-AUFSCHLÜSSELUNG (KOMPAKT) ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6 bg-surface relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="aufschlüsselung-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="aufschlüsselung-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Wie der Stundensatz entsteht
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          110 €/h sind nicht ausgedacht. Sie basieren auf einer dezidierten Kalkulation
          aus realen Kosten und einem Qualitäts- & Risikopuffer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-10">
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg border border-border text-center">
          <div class="text-5xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">92 €</div>
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2 text-lg">Kostendeckung</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Reale Kosten und Steuern. Alles, was nötig ist, um nachhaltig zu arbeiten
            – ohne Übergewinn, ohne aufgeblähte Struktur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg border border-border text-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-5xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">18 €</div>
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2 text-lg">Qualitäts- & Risikopuffer</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            All-in-One-Kompetenz ohne Juniors. Du zahlst für Erfahrung, die direkt
            einsetzbar ist – und für die Sicherheit, dass Festpreise Festpreise bleiben.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal text-center">
        <a href="/de/preise/kalkulation/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary hover:text-primary-light font-medium transition-colors group">
          Vollständige Kostenaufstellung ansehen
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== FESTPREISPAKETE ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6 bg-bg relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="pakete-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="pakete-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Festpreispakete
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Definierter Umfang, fester Preis, keine Überraschungen.
          Jedes Paket ist individuell anpassbar – als Basis oder Ausgangspunkt.
        </p>
      </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        <!-- SEO Quick Win -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">SEO-Quick-Win-Analyse</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary font-display mb-2">990 €</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Einmalig · ca. 8 Stunden</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Technisches SEO-Audit</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Top-5-Prioritäten-Liste</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Umsetzungsempfehlungen</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Dokumentation & Report</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-primary text-primary font-semibold hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- SEO Monatsbetreuung -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">SEO-Monatsbetreuung</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary font-display mb-2">2.200 €<span class="text-lg text-text-secondary font-normal">/Monat</span></div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Laufend · 20 Stunden/Monat · Mind. 3 Monate</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Onpage-Optimierung & Content</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Technisches Monitoring</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Keyword-Tracking & Reporting</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Monatlicher Strategie-Call</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-primary text-primary font-semibold hover:bg-primary hover:text-white transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Google Ads Setup -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-spectrum-pink/50 shadow-lg shadow-spectrum-pink/10 relative transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-3 py-1 bg-spectrum-pink text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-full">Beliebt</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 15l-2 5L9 9l11 4-5 2zm0 0l5 5M7.188 2.239l.777 2.897M5.136 7.965l-2.898-.777M13.95 4.05l-2.122 2.122m-5.657 5.656l-2.12 2.122"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Google-Ads-Setup</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-pink font-display mb-2">1.650 €</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Einmalig · ca. 15 Stunden</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Kampagnen-Struktur & Setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion-Tracking</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>4 Wochen Optimierung</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Übergabe & Dokumentation</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink text-white font-semibold hover:brightness-110 transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- PPC Setup -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-pink/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">PPC-Setup</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-pink font-display mb-2">1.320 €</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Einmalig · ca. 12 Stunden</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Microsoft Ads ODER Meta Ads</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Kampagnen-Struktur & Creatives</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion-Tracking & Pixel</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>4 Wochen Optimierung & Übergabe</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-pink text-spectrum-pink font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-pink hover:text-white transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Landingpage -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Landingpage</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-blue font-display mb-2">1.980 €</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Einmalig · ca. 18 Stunden</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion-optimiertes Design</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Entwicklung (Astro oder WordPress)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Formular-Integration & Tracking</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>A/B-Test-Setup & Launch</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-blue text-spectrum-blue font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-blue hover:text-white transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Website 5 Seiten -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Website (5 Seiten)</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-blue font-display mb-2">4.950 €</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Einmalig · ca. 45 Stunden</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Design & Entwicklung (Astro)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>SEO-Basis & Mobile-First</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Tracking-Integration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Hosting-Setup & Launch</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-blue text-spectrum-blue font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-blue hover:text-white transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Website 10 Seiten -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Website (10 Seiten)</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-blue font-display mb-2">8.800 €</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Einmalig · ca. 80 Stunden</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Umfassendes Design & Entwicklung</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Erweiterte SEO-Struktur</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Content-Management-Integration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Hosting, Launch & Dokumentation</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-blue text-spectrum-blue font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-blue hover:text-white transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tracking Setup -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-yellow/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Tracking-Setup</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-spectrum-yellow font-display mb-2">ab 990 €</div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-6">Einmalig · je nach Umfang</p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>GA4 / Matomo Basis-Setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Google Tag Manager Konfiguration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Conversion-Tracking</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Consent-Management & DSGVO</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="block text-center py-3 rounded-lg border border-spectrum-yellow text-spectrum-yellow font-semibold hover:bg-spectrum-yellow hover:text-bg transition-all">
            Anfragen
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== FAIRNESS-GRUNDSÄTZE ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface" aria-labelledby="fairness-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="fairness-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Fairness-Grundsätze
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Preise sind Vertrauenssache. Diese Regeln gelten für jedes Projekt.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">Keine aufgeblähten Pakete</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Du zahlst nur für das, was Du wirklich brauchst. Keine überdimensionierten All-in-One-Pakete mit Leistungen, die niemand nutzt.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">Keine versteckten Kosten</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Was im Angebot steht, zahlst Du. Tools, Lizenzen und Fremdleistungen werden vorab separat ausgewiesen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">Kein Übergewinn</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Der Stundensatz ist fair kalkuliert, nicht ausgedacht. Festpreise gelten, auch wenn ich länger brauche.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2">Korrektur statt Rechnung</h3>
